{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "276bed35245cb54bb1b5df0804d95864184a94c76e8e1de8052c195d35ce9cc1", "ja": "（社長に、急に呼び出された）", "zh": "（突然被社长叫了过来。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ddec78c4728fef24ff76916f0e5050b7782b58ccbef889d461cac61a4047fe71", "ja": "（「後は頼んだよ！」って言われたけど……\nこの子のオーディションを続ければいいのかな？）", "zh": "（社长说「接下来就交给你了！」……\n所以我只要继续面试这位女孩就行了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "27856860e8c29a5eea8fd19c4444f3ebb7275dc9e3877d8a0ba23eaf6fc027f9", "ja": "馬場このみと申します。\n本日は、よろしくお願いいたします。", "zh": "我叫做马场木实。\n今天请你多多指教。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4c04927bd79d70da87901df8360cfad6cdf5c4fac21cb652c86c707b61c499a8", "ja": "（年齢は……中学生くらいか。\nまだ小さいのに、ずいぶんとしっかりした子だ）", "zh": "（年龄看起来……差不多是国中生吧。\n小小年纪，倒是挺有礼貌的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1004_p", "source_sha256": "45a773e4542b56583a4d5f38d5203f7c494f2d46ee69b3b771624c7dabc9fcf5", "ja": "こちらこそ、よろしくお願いします。\nそれじゃ、まずは志望動機から聞かせてもらえますか？", "zh": "彼此彼此，也要请你多多指教了。\n那么，可以先请教一下你为什么想进本公司吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "8151946750f01ccbbd81086781572d34f90f8928ae249ad735259e84a7e559a3", "ja": "はい。御社を志望したのは、\nこれまでの経験を生かせると思ったからです。", "zh": "好的。我之所以会应征贵公司，\n是认为可以活用以往的经验。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0957609e868bb82ef3077560c9437b243f9d6c2ba5e434d932baaf76373f0dfe", "ja": "経験……。\nどこかで、歌やダンスをしていたとか？", "zh": "经验……\n你以前有过其他唱歌跳舞的经验吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "78502956a1a8e8ff763821522907c835ca13c4500dccb4d1ea040ea9c89407c7", "ja": "えっ！？\nう、歌やダンスですか？", "zh": "咦！？\n唱、唱歌跳舞吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1008_p", "source_sha256": "84b87421d0a57fc4bbed95152e0e5a7969fb98852065202e021938cd4ab2be4b", "ja": "？　ええ。", "zh": "嗯？是啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "e5dd73748354958be88ac620963b67825d721b1eb1d89ed896330f09ebddb81b", "ja": "そ、そうですね……。たまに、友人と\nカラオケに行ったりするくらいですけど……。", "zh": "经、经验是吗……\n我只有偶尔和朋友去唱唱卡拉OK而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "a720616df0ab3c8cd33a9466294e41ed6bb616fca5c8a31f76b07ecc1f31ff9a", "ja": "でも、評判は悪くないと思います！\nいつも盛り上がってますし！", "zh": "不过，我的歌声应该不错！\n大家都听得很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b74c59aa4c4836d79ce78d472ee4bffde0e039c4feadddcdfc30e01ba4af293d", "ja": "ふむふむ、歌は得意と……。\nそれじゃ、ダンスはどうですか？", "zh": "原来如此，擅长唱歌……\n那么，舞蹈又如何呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "c3830bd9c7728ce76886a4bc94defacf1c4fc3e88a51e3d6c484344af2a325f0", "ja": "だ、ダンスですか？\n授業で、創作ダンスくらいしかしたことないけど……。", "zh": "舞、舞蹈吗？\n我只有在体育课跳过自创舞蹈而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "417755771988a272fbc3c8c12e33f3776f458fc46569b192a8218250548ee66d", "ja": "でも、運動神経はそんなに悪くないです！", "zh": "不过，我还算有运动细胞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1014_p", "source_sha256": "cef715d2f81ecd63d981bd3b70ee5c0d930c26324062b27b830458f9bdf144b2", "ja": "ダンスもOK、と。\n他に、アピールしたいことはありますか？", "zh": "看来舞蹈也没问题。\n那么，请问还有其他特长吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "72abbe69c25fdbd246d422dbcbbbed752348f962b49cc36fa0b5953831845677", "ja": "はい、即戦力として働けることです！\n以前の会社でも、事務として仕事をしていました。", "zh": "是，我可以马上开始工作！\n因为我在以前的公司负责的也是事务工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7c35399f1faccfc784decd9c378d2454ab0f5ca588f2f2c527afa026b84ee3b1", "ja": "（……ん？）", "zh": "（……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "ba8effe7cf24f7faa9a4a111b7a5e3afae305ddaf6032761d5ba9ad0aa2d8e84", "ja": "あとは大学在学中から、卒業した後も、\n色々な資格の勉強をしています！", "zh": "还有，我在就读大学时和毕业之后\n都有进修许多证照课程！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6dcc133ce16559ca4ec86f7856550dc5d975d8c322c8acad6382aaa8989f9fed", "ja": "大学を……卒業？", "zh": "大学……毕业？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1019_039kon", "source_sha256": "9eed223fe36ccca86621af8a617a383f940aee9886a50d37f1b3f15e9f15ef26", "ja": "……。\n何かご不審な点でも？", "zh": "……\n请问有什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1020_p", "source_sha256": "42db938b2e248922b6a0c22bbed65b4efaf2587ecf394f53647819e82903ecc4", "ja": "いえ別に。そうでしたか、社会人の方……。\nその社会人の方が、どうしてアイドルに？", "zh": "不，没什么。原来是这样，你已经是社会人士了……\n为什么社会人士会想当偶像呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "0c63335727f5206833aa83f447200990cf673364f867aba8c34a20c5edac76f3", "ja": "アイドル！？\n……私、事務員として面接に来たんですけど？？", "zh": "偶像！？\n……不好意思，我以为我是来面试事务员？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1022_p", "source_sha256": "cf784dc8488275797d57732539b88ede2514867c53e9f09c9da31fe5111a0ae5", "ja": "は？", "zh": "啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "53f3ff0b93c3f8f788c73ddf34da0a03f62370bb03efd60de144a01cc0df38c8", "ja": "事務員。オフィスレディ志望ですっ！", "zh": "事务员。我想当OL！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1024_p", "source_sha256": "d86aca0775d1e1c9cd0d668382f4941f9f1cc7fe321f5b85232414395d7844d0", "ja": "そ、そうだったんですか！\nすみません、引き継ぎが出来ていなくて……。", "zh": "原、原来是这样吗！？\n非常抱歉，刚才没有交接清楚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1025_p", "source_sha256": "d7c4c99465fb6c2a1e4c77972bec26db238ea71eeacb901c53abe26d1bf5d862", "ja": "うちの事務所は今、39プロジェクトという企画で、\nアイドル候補を探していまして……。", "zh": "因为我们事务所现在正好有个企划叫39PROJECT，\n目前还在寻找加入的偶像候补人选……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1026_p", "source_sha256": "e4917171da25422d49397d49d50f6a716468f9a1d5e876acbb7d7f8879cecde4", "ja": "てっきり、そのオーディションを受けに来た方かと。", "zh": "所以我还以为你是来参加甄选的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1027_039kon", "source_sha256": "f0c3742fc9db36682d0113ca5fc562ef10586448ecefe910489d74764288a2f8", "ja": "なるほど……。お互い、勘違いしてたんですね。\nどうりで、何だか話が噛み合わないと思ったわ！", "zh": "原来如此……看来我们双方都误会了。\n难怪我觉得牛头不对马嘴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1028_039kon", "source_sha256": "98df2138413b11a63cb56964976514ca4b82461eb52390092024c1d43f76c73b", "ja": "でも、私をアイドル志望と思うだなんて……。\n悪い気はしないわね。ウフフッ♪", "zh": "不过，你居然以为我是来应征偶像……\n感觉倒不坏呢，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1029_p", "source_sha256": "75844dde17e4494af363adbb2d8a0db13ba362eeefa154268fe91752e733cc89", "ja": "（社長からちゃんと話を聞いておけばよかった。\nでも、この見た目と実年齢のギャップは……面白い！）", "zh": "（早知道就该跟社长问清楚的。\n不过，她的外表与实际年龄的落差……很有趣！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_1030", "source_sha256": "af64cb5745e12f46015965a25065eec951dbf0fe41fc1cee6cc18e96b64fe4f6", "ja": "名刺を取り出す", "zh": "拿出名片", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "7710f7116963fe2047353c7ecd6df269a15113e8e31e96933eb40fc4dc1a009c", "ja": "馬場このみさん。もしよかったら、\n本当にアイドルとしてやってみませんか？", "zh": "马场木实小姐，如果你不介意的话，\n要不要真的来当当看偶像呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_2001_039kon", "source_sha256": "2042b4130882a58cb4104159a9e06dcef088a142f140b8e1d2a583d151305608", "ja": "ええっ！？　アイドルって……私が！？", "zh": "什么！？偶像……你说我吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_2002_p", "source_sha256": "b22e3e6d8ead587d15c4275186ef3a46704f2fa7f0749972565097c8e4808600", "ja": "はい。あなたなら、\nきっと新しいタイプのアイドルになれると思います！", "zh": "是的。\n我认为你一定能成为新型态的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_2003_039kon", "source_sha256": "f3d99c5a2ed1b3081e3838a9e01a479098778371a545be6fbf3db75f19363dac", "ja": "うーん、アイドルねぇ。\n私、就職したかったんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯──偶像是吗？\n但我想从事一般工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_2004_p", "source_sha256": "3a967471e90f3cd0fb9f28343c9ccb9e1a6d5aa9439534f72d82fd9694a4dd09", "ja": "その容姿のギャップは、このみさんの魅力です！\n急な話ですが、考えてもらえませんか？", "zh": "木实小姐，你外表的落差是很大的魅力！\n我知道很突然，但能请你考虑看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_001_2005_039kon", "source_sha256": "93dfd92829f76a3fdac8390c7a52125b9ffc464d3f730368f182658784449766", "ja": "容姿のギャップ……それって、\n私がセクシーで魅力的だってことね？", "zh": "外表的落差……你的意思是说，\n我很性感又有魅力吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
